/Points ED n 2 mul -2 roll } { false NArray } ifelse n 4 lt { n { pop
pop } repeat } { BAC /n n 4 sub def n { NAC } repeat EAC } ifelse } def
/ClosedCurve { NArray n 3 lt { n { pop pop } repeat } { n 3 gt {
